  "requirements": [
    "No forced mat_queue_mode=0 in a production RT profile.",
    "Retain supported threaded particle/detail-prop and queued-rope paths; hiding objects is not validation.",
    "Prove actual work and overlap, not just CVar values or total thread count.",
    "Preserve correct Source queue order and subsequent DeviceBridge order independently.",
    "Keep D3D9 state changes with the actual draw on its owner thread.",
    "Own asynchronous metadata and dynamic resource versions through consumption and GPU completion as applicable.",
